            "review_title": "Review at Kali Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Heloise R\nHanoi, Vietnam2 contributions\n0\nAmazing experience !\nAug 2024 • Friends\nKali is a relaxed, outdoor spot serving simple and tasty Mediterranean food. Their fresh pita, mezze, and sharing platters are full of flavor. The garden setting feels cozy, making it a great place to hang out with friends. Perfect for anyone looking for good food in a chill atmosphere.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten September 25, 2024",
