            "review_title": "Review at Kali Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Franck G\nCat Ba, Vietnam17 contributions\n0\nBest outdoor place to hang out\nJul 2024 • Friends\nKali Restaurant in Tay Ho is easily one of my favorite spots in Hanoi. The laid-back vibe, open-air garden, and welcoming atmosphere make it the perfect place to hang out. Their events are always on point, with live music, DJ sets, and their iconic movie nights, which are a real treat for anyone who enjoys a good film in a cozy outdoor setting.\n\nBut let’s talk food: Kali’s Capri burger is absolutely delicious! Highly recommend checking it out!\nRead more\nWritten September 21, 2024",
