            "review_title": "Review at Kali Restaurant",
            "review_text": "TanjungBaraDiver\nHanoi, Vietnam1974 contributions\n0\nA lot of promise\nMar 2023 • Couples\nThere's a good view over the lake, and great areas for lounging around as well as formal dining. We over ordered a bit but everything was just a bit bland. Meats were dry. I had probably set myself up for some classic middle eastern stuff which in fact it was, just so so. Service was OK but hard to catch people's attention sometimes. We probably won't be rushing back despite living nearby.\n\nTwo of the most annoying points were the fact that there was music playing in the front but different music out the back. We were sitting in the middle and getting the worst of both worlds. They also allow smoking at the front, and with an Easterly breeze, the entire restaurant got to share it.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten April 2, 2023\nKali Hanoï\nDear customer,\n\nWe thank you for coming to eat at Kali and for leaving a review. We pay great attention to all the opinions given by our customers.\n\nWe are sorry that your experience was not perfect and will do everything to ensure that it does not happen again.\n\nSee you at Kali !\nRead more\nWritten September 21, 2024\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
