            "review_title": "Review at Kali Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Leannie\nHong Kong, China3214 contributions\n1\nRefreshing change from pho\nSep 2022 • Couples\nCane where for some Mediterranean food and was not disappointed!\nEnjoyed a shared meze platter consisting of chicken shwarma, falafel, baba gounosh and hummus etc. There was onto one portion of pitta allocated which was nowhere near enough and a little on the stale side, we ordered a 2nd portion and this came out lovely and hot and much fresher so much better \nCool vive and decoration, only thing that let It down slightly was how slow the service was, bearing in mind there were only 2 couples inside and about 5 members of staff we could see the service was slow. But none the less it made a refreshing change from pho!\nRead more\nWritten September 6, 2022\nKali Hanoï\nDear customer,\n\nWe thank you for coming to eat at Kali and for leaving a refreshing review ! We pay great attention to all the opinions given by our customers.\n\nWe are sorry that your experience was not perfect and will do everything to ensure that it does not happen again.\n\nSee you at Kali !\nRead more\nWritten September 21, 2024\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
